() Tj T*
(Labour Act.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SCOPE OF WORK) Tj T*
(This specification covers supply, installation, testing and commissioning of lt) Tj T*
(electrical distribution system complete in all respects.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SITE CONDITIONS) Tj T*
(i\) All equipment shall be suitable for operation at an ambient air temperature not) Tj T*
(exceeding 40 Deg.C. The equipment shall be suitable for relative humidity up to 95 per) Tj T*
(cent.) Tj T*
(ii\) Site altitude does not exceed 1000 m above MSL.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION 4: MAIN LT PANEL) Tj T*
(i\) Switchboards shall be designed, manufactured and tested in accordance with IS/IEC) Tj T*
(61439-1:2020 and IS/IEC 61439-2:2020.) Tj T*
(ii\) Panels shall be free standing, totally enclosed, made of 2 mm. thick CRCA sheet with) Tj T*
(powder coated finish.) Tj T*
(iii\) The panel shall be suitable for 415 Volts ± 10 per cent, 50 Hz, 3 phase 4 wire) Tj T*
(system.) Tj T*
(iv\) The horizontal busbar shall be high conductivity aluminium alloy of 1600A rating.) Tj T*
(v\) Short time withstand rating of the switchboard shall be 50kA for 1 s.) Tj T*
(vi\) Enclosure protection class for the switchboard shall be IP 54.) Tj T*
(vii\) Internal separation of functional units shall be Form 4.) Tj T*
(viii\) Incoming breaker shall be 1600A four pole draw-out ACB as per IS/IEC 60947-2:2003) Tj T*
(with microprocessor release.) Tj T*
(ix\) All outgoing MCCBs shall have a rated service breaking capacity of not less than) Tj T*
(36kA.) Tj T*
(x\) Each incomer shall be provided with a digital multifunction meter with RS-485 port.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signature of Bidder) Tj T*
(Page 2 of 5) Tj T*
