(GUARANTEED TECHNICAL PARTICULARS — LT PANEL) Tj T*
(Rated operational voltage: 415 Volts) Tj T*
(Busbar current rating: 1600A) Tj T*
(Rated short-time withstand current: 50kA for 1 sec) Tj T*
(Enclosure protection: IP54) Tj T*
(Make and type: \(to be furnished by the bidder\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5 TECHNICAL SPECIFICATION — LT POWER AND CONTROL CABLES) Tj T*
(i\) LT power cables shall be XLPE insulated 1.1 kV grade armoured cables with aluminium) Tj T*
(conductors as per IS 7098 \(Part 1\):1988.) Tj T*
(ii\) Size of the incoming feeder cable shall be 3.5 core x 300 sqmm.) Tj T*
(iii\) Continuous conductor operating temperature of XLPE cables shall be 90 Deg.C. Copper) Tj T*
(control cables of 2.5 sqmm shall be PVC insulated heavy duty type as per IS 1554 \(Part) Tj T*
(1\).) Tj T*
(iv\) Cable conductors shall meet the resistance requirements of IS 8130 for class 2) Tj T*
(conductors.) Tj T*
(v\) Cables shall be laid directly in ground at a depth of 750 mm. with brick protection.) Tj T*
(vi\) Terminations shall be made with brass double compression glands and tinned copper) Tj T*
(lugs. Cable drums shall carry marking of size, type, length and manufacturer's name.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6 TESTS AND INSPECTION) Tj T*
(i\) Each switchboard shall be subjected to routine verification tests as per IS/IEC) Tj T*
(61439-1 at the works.) Tj T*
(ii\) The bidder shall furnish type test reports of the switchboard and breakers from an) Tj T*
(NABL accredited laboratory.) Tj T*
(iii\) Acceptance tests on cables shall be carried out as per IS 10810 in presence of the) Tj T*
(Engineer.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signature of Bidder) Tj T*
(Page 3 of 5) Tj T*
